   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board is pleased to confirm that it expects revenue, profit and free cash flow for the year to 31 December 2022 to be in line with current consensus market forecasts, which are shown at the foot of this announcement 1",
